{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777349193467","title":"Nilai model dibatasi oleh distribusi data latihnya","desc":"Keterbatasan LLM sering berasal dari data latih yang digunakan, bukan hanya arsitektur atau penyedia model.","updated":1777349975837,"created":1777349205612,"tags":["zettel","ai","data","grounding","the-developers-guide-to-ai","part-i"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"d1de328170c3c28cfd5524e4d4a7e664","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.data","alias":"data","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.data"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.grounding","alias":"grounding","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.grounding"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.part-i","alias":"part-i","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.part-i"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1202},"end":{"line":24,"column":51,"offset":1250},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777349193467","id":"zettel.1777349193467","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1253},"end":{"line":25,"column":48,"offset":1298},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.1777362905431","id":"zettel.1777362905431","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":3,"offset":2096},"end":{"line":39,"column":27,"offset":2120},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777349193467"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"quote-baseline":{"type":"header","text":"Quote baseline","value":"quote-baseline","line":21,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-core":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini core","value":"kenapa-ini-core","line":25,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":29,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":36,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"nilai-model-dibatasi-oleh-distribusi-data-latihnya\">Nilai model dibatasi oleh distribusi data latihnya<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#nilai-model-dibatasi-oleh-distribusi-data-latihnya\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang gue tangkap dari quote “A model is only as good as the data it was trained on” adalah bahwa batasan LLM sering lebih berasal dari distribusi data latih daripada dari jumlah parameter, provider, atau hype. Model bisa fasih dan impresif, tetapi jika training-nya tidak mewakili domain yang mau kita pakai, ia akan sering meleset.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quote-baseline\">Quote baseline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#quote-baseline\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A model is only as good as the data it was trained on.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-core\">Kenapa ini core<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-core\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini penting karena dia menempatkan problem AI bukan hanya di level model, tetapi pada asal-usul knowledge model itu sendiri. Itu jadi node induk untuk isu seperti hallucination, bias, stale knowledge, dan kenapa grounding domain diperlukan.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kalau model dilatih dengan distribusi data yang salah, outputnya bisa generik, bias, atau tidak relevan.</li>\n<li>Ini membantu menjelaskan kenapa model besar tidak otomatis berarti cocok untuk semua use case.</li>\n<li>Ini juga menegaskan bahwa domain grounding dan retrieval bukan pelengkap saja, tapi respon terhadap batasan training distribution.</li>\n<li>Dalam konteks buku, ini memperkuat argumentasi bahwa adopsi AI praktis perlu fokus pada data dan konteks, bukan hanya model terbaik.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">data (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">grounding (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">part-i (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777362905431\">Grounding adalah menyuplai konteks yang hilang saat inference tanpa mengubah model</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaul